# Source-of-truth mapping for hermes-llama@.service template instances.
# Read by /home/hermes-pi/.hermes/scripts/llama-resolve-config.sh which is
# invoked by the unit to resolve LLAMA_MODEL for a given instance port.
#
# Format: <port> <absolute_gguf_path>
#
# 8080 — Hermes-LCM summary compression (dedicated, do not repurpose)
# 8081 — General local agent (Qwen3-0.6B-Instruct-Q8_0)
# 8082 — General local agent (microsoft Phi-4-mini-instruct-Q4_K_M)
#
# Edit port→model bindings by editing THIS file. systemd keeps running units
# on the old binding until `systemctl --user restart hermes-llama@PORT`.

